  "solution": {
    "text": "Acceleration due to gravity at depth d from the surface of the earth or at a distance $r$ from the centre ' $O$ ' of the earth $g^{\\prime}=\\frac{4}{3} \\pi \\rho G r$ Hence $g^{\\prime} \\propto r$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6W_urH2LBpJ6bY8iBj8seUOML61frWDSdYocY29cF4s.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
